TITLE:: CommandSuggestion
SUMMARY:: One row in the command prompt's suggestion list.
CATEGORIES:: GUI>Views
RELATED:: Classes/BorderView, Classes/CommandPrompt, Classes/CommandChip, Classes/Pen

DESCRIPTION::
TELETYPE::CommandSuggestion:: is a LINK::Classes/BorderView:: for one suggested command, parameter, or value under a LINK::Classes/CommandPrompt::. The highlighted row is the same class with a different background colour.

The label is drawn with LINK::Classes/Pen#-stringLeftJustIn:: in the row's own bounds, in white, left aligned, and centred vertically. LINK::Classes/CommandPrompt:: gives every visible row the same width and the text field's height.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
Creates a TELETYPE::CommandSuggestion::.

ARGUMENT:: text
The label shown on the row, as a LINK::Classes/String::.

ARGUMENT:: colour
The background LINK::Classes/Color::. LINK::Classes/CommandPrompt:: passes the normal or highlighted suggestion colour.

ARGUMENT:: width
The fixed width in pixels, as a LINK::Classes/SimpleNumber::. All rows in one suggestion list share the width of the longest label.

ARGUMENT:: height
The fixed height in pixels, as a LINK::Classes/SimpleNumber::.

RETURNS::
A new TELETYPE::CommandSuggestion:: instance.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: string
The label text shown on the row.

RETURNS::
A LINK::Classes/String::.

PRIVATE:: prInit
